    "text": "The value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> is equal to (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is the constant of integration)"
